@cjgillot I think we'll need to remove the ordering traits from `HirId` separately. [`ConstraintCategory` ](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/nightly-rustc/rustc_middle/mir/query/enum.ConstraintCategory.html) causes lots of problems that are not easy to fix if `HirId` is not `Ord`. I attempted manually implementing `Ord` for `ConstraintCategory`, without success.

@nikomatsakis recommend using a [`Field`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/nightly-rustc/rustc_middle/mir/struct.Field.html) [here](https://doc.rust-lang.org/nightly/nightly-rustc/src/rustc_middle/mir/query.rs.html#343) instead of a `HirId`. Again, this proved beyond my reach. But I suspect that is the correct direction.

Overall, I think this PR does move us a little closer to the goals of https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/90317, even as is.

